                    Anda tidak melakukan aktivitas selama beberapa waktu. Demi keamanan data akun Anda, sesi akan otomatis keluar dalam:
                </p>
                <div class="py-2 mb-2">
                    <span class="badge bg-warning-subtle text-warning-emphasis px-3 py-2 rounded-pill fw-bold" style="font-size: 20px; border: 1px solid #fde68a;">
                        <i class="bi bi-clock-history me-1"></i> <span id="idleCountdownDisplay">60</span> detik
                    </span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-secondary small mb-0" style="font-size: 11.5px;">
                    Klik <strong>Tetap Masuk</strong> untuk terus menggunakan aplikasi tanpa harus login ulang.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer border-0 pt-0 pb-4 px-4 flex-column gap-2">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-success w-100 py-2 fw-bold d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-2" id="stayLoggedInBtn" style="border-radius: 14px; font-size: 13.5px; background: #16a34a; border-color: #16a34a; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.3);">
                    <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>
                    Tetap Masuk
                </button>
                <a href="/logout" class="btn btn-light w-100 py-2 fw-semibold text-muted d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-2" style="border-radius: 14px; font-size: 13px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background: #f8fafc;">
                    <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right"></i>
                    Keluar Sekarang
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Floating Realtime Toast Center -->
<div id="realtimeToastContainer" class="toast-container position-fixed top-0 end-0 p-3" style="z-index: 99999; pointer-events: none;"></div>

</body>

